---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Sales & CRM Enrichment"
description: "Enrich existing CRM contact records with available caller-name and carrier intelligence. Add context to phone data, investigate unknown numbers, and flag records that may need review."
---
{%- from "partials/macros.njk" import arrow, dot %}

<section class="page-hero page-hero--crumbs" aria-labelledby="page-title">
	<div class="wrap">
		{%- set crumbs = [{ label: "Solutions", href: "/solutions/" }] %}
		{%- set crumbCurrent = "Sales & CRM Enrichment" %}
		{%- include "partials/crumbs.njk" %}
		<div class="pair page-hero__grid">
			<div class="pair__copy">
				<p class="label label--ink">Sales &amp; CRM Enrichment</p>
				<h1 id="page-title" class="h1">Your CRM has phone numbers. Make them more useful.</h1>
				<p class="lede--hero">Enrich existing contact records with available caller-name and carrier intelligence.</p>
				<p class="text">Use xGO to add context to phone data, investigate unknown numbers, and identify records that may need review.</p>
				<div class="actions actions--mt">
					<a class="btn btn--ink" href="/products/">Explore Products</a>
					<a class="btn btn--line" href="/contact/">Contact Sales</a>
				</div>
			</div>
			<figure class="pair__visual pair__visual--wide table-card table-card--shadow">
				<div class="table-card__head">
					<p class="panel__title">Contact records</p>
					<p class="label">Illustrative</p>
				</div>
				<div class="table-card__scroll">
					<table class="data-table">
						<thead>
							<tr>
								<th scope="col">phone</th>
								<th scope="col">name in CRM</th>
								<th scope="col" class="th-accent">caller ID name</th>
								<th scope="col">record</th>
							</tr>
						</thead>
						<tbody>
							<tr>
								<td>+1 212 555 0101</td>
								<td>EXAMPLE BUSINESS</td>
								<td>EXAMPLE BUSINESS</td>
								<td><span class="status">{{ dot("dot--ink") }}Matches</span></td>
							</tr>
							<tr>
								<td>+1 212 555 0102</td>
								<td class="muted">—</td>
								<td>EXAMPLE SERVICES</td>
								<td><span class="status">{{ dot() }}Added</span></td>
							</tr>
							<tr>
								<td>+1 212 555 0103</td>
								<td>EXAMPLE CO</td>
								<td>EXAMPLE HOLDINGS</td>
								<td><span class="status status--accent">{{ dot("dot--hollow dot--accent") }}Review</span></td>
							</tr>
							<tr>
								<td>+1 212 555 0104</td>
								<td>EXAMPLE GROUP</td>
								<td class="muted">not available</td>
								<td><span class="status status--muted">{{ dot("dot--hollow dot--muted") }}Unchanged</span></td>
							</tr>
						</tbody>
					</table>
				</div>
				<figcaption class="table-card__caption">Caller-name records are not proof of subscriber identity. Use them as context alongside your existing data.</figcaption>
			</figure>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<section class="section section--line section--mist" aria-labelledby="challenge-title">
	<div class="wrap split">
		<p class="label split__label">The challenge</p>
		<div class="split__body">
			<h2 id="challenge-title" class="h2">Contact databases change.</h2>
			<ul class="returns returns--ink">
				<li class="returns__item">{{ dot("dot--ink") }}People move between companies.</li>
				<li class="returns__item">{{ dot("dot--ink") }}Phone numbers are reassigned.</li>
				<li class="returns__item">{{ dot("dot--ink") }}Carrier relationships change.</li>
			</ul>
			<div class="grid grid--250 grid--gap-md mt-md">
				<p class="text-md">Information collected months or years ago may no longer reflect the current record.</p>
				<p class="text-md">Your CRM may still contain a valid-looking phone number, but the surrounding information can be incomplete or inconsistent.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<section class="section section--line" aria-labelledby="help-title">
	<div class="wrap">
		<div class="split">
			<p class="label split__label">How <span class="brand">xGO</span> helps</p>
			<h2 id="help-title" class="h2 split__body">Add context to every contact.</h2>
		</div>
		<div class="grid cases">
			<div class="case">
				<p class="card__code">{{ dot() }}caller_name</p>
				<h3 class="case__title">Add caller-name context.</h3>
				<p class="text-sm">Retrieve available caller ID names to supplement existing records.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="case">
				<p class="card__code">{{ dot() }}carrier</p>
				<h3 class="case__title">Enrich carrier information.</h3>
				<p class="text-sm">Add supported carrier-related fields to phone records.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="case">
				<p class="card__code">{{ dot("dot--hollow dot--accent") }}review</p>
				<h3 class="case__title">Investigate inconsistencies.</h3>
				<p class="text-sm">Compare returned data against existing CRM fields.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="case">
				<p class="card__code">{{ dot("dot--ink") }}workflows</p>
				<h3 class="case__title">Support enrichment workflows.</h3>
				<p class="text-sm">Bring phone intelligence into the tools and processes your team already uses.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<section class="section section--line" aria-labelledby="uses-title">
	<div class="wrap split">
		<p class="label split__label">Common use cases</p>
		<div class="split__body">
			<h2 id="uses-title" class="h2">Where teams start.</h2>
			<div class="pills">
				<span class="pill">{{ dot() }}Contact database enrichment</span>
				<span class="pill">{{ dot() }}CRM cleanup</span>
				<span class="pill">{{ dot() }}Lead research</span>
				<span class="pill">{{ dot() }}Data migration projects</span>
				<span class="pill">{{ dot() }}Contact record investigation</span>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

{%- set cta = {
	title: "Get more from the phone data you already have.",
	text: "Explore xGO Phone Enrichment.",
	primary: { label: "Explore Phone Enrichment", href: "/products/phone-enrichment/" },
	secondary: { label: "Contact Sales", href: "/contact/" }
} %}
{%- include "partials/cta-card.njk" %}
